# 2. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Product name: MADAD DESK (مدد ڈیسک)

Tagline: Technology that understands people.

Madad Desk is an AI-powered, human-centred public-service platform designed to make public assistance and relief services more accessible, transparent, secure, and understandable.

It connects:
- Citizens seeking public assistance.
- Community helpers assisting multiple families.
- Government or department officers reviewing applications.
- Administrators managing eligibility rules and system configuration.
- Independent auditors monitoring decisions and system activity.

The platform uses responsible AI to assist with:
- Application processing.
- Identity and record matching.
- Eligibility assessment.
- Uncertainty detection.
- Scam and fraudulent-message detection.
- Voice-based accessibility.
- Human escalation.
- Explainable AI decisions.

The system must be accessible to people with limited technical literacy, including Urdu-speaking users.

